Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.orcaslicer.com/
Description: G-code generator for 3D printers
 OrcaSlicer slices 3D models into G-code for FDM printers, with profiles for
 many printers, calibration tools and a network connection to Bambu Lab,
 Klipper and other printers.
 .
 This package holds the AppImage of release v@ORCA_VERSION@, unpacked in
 /usr/lib/orcaslicer, with its own copies of zlib, liblzma, libexpat and
 libmspack. /usr/bin/orcaslicer starts it with software rendering on Mesa 26
 or newer, as the release crashes in the radeonsi driver of Mesa 26.
